# Venture GP Atlas — frontend build-time variables (Vite)
# On Railway set VITE_API_URL as a service variable; the Dockerfile passes it to the build.
# Leave unset for the standard single-service deploy (the API is served from the same address at /api/v1).
# Only set it when the frontend is hosted separately from the backend.
# VITE_API_URL=https://<backend-domain>/api/v1
